        <mxCell id="37" value="ADMIN API SECURITY CHECKLIST
Authentication: Bearer JWT | Authorization: requireRole(admin) + loadAuthUser | Network: adminIpAllowlist | Session: adminSessionTimeout (JWT iat) | Rate: adminLimiter | Audit: adminAudit → admin_audit_logs
POST /admin/block-user: parseStrictPositiveInt userId, sanitizeString reason, blockedRepo.blockEntity, UPDATE users, fraudEngine.recordSuspicious critical
Refund: createAdminApproval PENDING → second admin approveAction → razorpayService.createRefund → payment_refunds + payment_orders REFUNDED → Socket payment:update" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#333333;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1300" width="2880" height="350" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
